<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech 13-wk T-bills gross 12.0 pct, demand heavy.</title>
<headline>Czech 13-wk T-bills gross 12.0 pct, demand heavy.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gross yield in a Dutch auction offering six billion crowns in 13-week Czech Finance Ministry treasury bills was 12.0 percent, and the auction was heavily oversubscribed with bids totalling 15.5 billion crowns, the Czech National Bank said.</p>
<p>Net yield was 9.0 percent, slightly lower than the 9.075 percent in the last auction of similar bills on February 20.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
